## SteelTube — .gitignore
## .NET Framework 4.8 / WPF / SQLite solution built with Visual Studio 2022

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Build output
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
[Bb]in/
[Oo]bj/
[Dd]ebug/
[Rr]elease/
x64/
x86/
[Ll]og/
[Ll]ogs/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Visual Studio / VS Code
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.vs/
.vscode/
*.user
*.suo
*.userosscache
*.sln.docstates
*.userprefs

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# NuGet
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.nupkg
*.snupkg
**/packages/*
!**/packages/build/
*.nuget.props
*.nuget.targets
project.lock.json
project.fragment.lock.json
artifacts/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Test results
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
[Tt]est[Rr]esult*/
[Bb]uild[Ll]og.*
*.trx
*.coverage
*.coveragexml
BenchmarkDotNet.Artifacts/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# ReSharper / Rider
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
_ReSharper*/
*.[Rr]e[Ss]harper
*.DotSettings.user
.idea/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# SteelTube application data (SAD 23, SAD 45)
# Local SQLite databases, backups, and exported/synchronization files must
# never be committed — they are per-machine business data, not source code.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.db
*.db-shm
*.db-wal
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
*.sqlite3-shm
*.sqlite3-wal
/data/
/backups/
/exports/
*.stbackup

# Synchronization packages exchanged between devices (SAD 30-32) are
# runtime artifacts, not source — keep sample/fixture files explicitly
# tracked instead if ever needed (git add -f).
sync-*.json

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# OS files
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
.DS_Store

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Misc
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.tmp
*.bak
*.cache
*.log